    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A perfect combination of genres</h2>Your goal is to destroy all bricks and enemies. Collect dropped power-ups but make sure not to miss a ball.  Swing your hand to hit the ball just like in Air Hockey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge the bullets or return them to enemies</h2>Enemies are trying to shoot your VR head, which takes the challenge to a new level. Dodge bullets or reflect them into the enemy.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In-game level editor and Workshop</h2>Try out your ideas and upload your own levels to the Steam Workshop. Download levels created by other players.  Full VR, no need to leave the game or use a mouse.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced boss fights: Some bosses are weak at the back, others can't be hit by the ball, etc. Each boss requires a unique approach to defeat it.<br></li><li>Air Hockey: additional game mode with few setups and exciting power-ups.<br></li><li>Local multiplayer: compete or team up with your friend. Player-2 will play on the monitor using a mouse.<br></li><li>Flexible difficulty: 8 gameplay modifiers and 5 game difficulties are available. Play in your own style.<br></li><li>Quick room setup: mega easy to calibrate room. Just hold one button to set direction and table height. Several seconds to do!  </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>LIV support and smooth camera  for creating a great video content. </li></ul><br><i><br>Players who try VR for the first time can fully enjoy the game. Because everyone knows how to play Air Hockey :). But the real challenge appears when you have to dodge enemy bullets and collect power ups while tracking the ball.<br><br>The game is perfect for those who just want to press the &quot;Play&quot; button and immediately get ton of fun and activity.  Personally I really don't like spending time on room calibration. Luckily, in VRNOID you just hold the Thumbstick for a few seconds to adjust the height and direction. Additionally, you can play it while sitting or standing.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A perfect combination of genres</h2>Your goal is to destroy all bricks and enemies. Collect dropped power-ups but make sure not to miss a ball.  Swing your hand to hit the ball just like in Air Hockey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/30060dffe684024ad73948afa90145fa.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge the bullets or return them to enemies</h2>Enemies are trying to shoot your VR head, which takes the challenge to a new level. Dodge bullets or reflect them into the enemy.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/701d1b982462dfbcf1d84ce7fd1eb270.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In-game level editor and Workshop</h2>Try out your ideas and upload your own levels to the Steam Workshop. Download levels created by other players.  Full VR, no need to leave the game or use a mouse.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.poster.avif?t=1707762975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.webm?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488510/extras/072bba70217811fc51a1988d8ea758fc.mp4?t=1707762975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced boss fights: Some bosses are weak at the back, others can't be hit by the ball, etc. Each boss requires a unique approach to defeat it.<br></li><li>Air Hockey: additional game mode with few setups and exciting power-ups.<br></li><li>Local multiplayer: compete or team up with your friend. Player-2 will play on the monitor using a mouse.<br></li><li>Flexible difficulty: 8 gameplay modifiers and 5 game difficulties are available. Play in your own style.<br></li><li>Quick room setup: mega easy to calibrate room. Just hold one button to set direction and table height. Several seconds to do!  </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>LIV support and smooth camera  for creating a great video content. </li></ul><br><i><br>Players who try VR for the first time can fully enjoy the game. Because everyone knows how to play Air Hockey :). But the real challenge appears when you have to dodge enemy bullets and collect power ups while tracking the ball.<br><br>The game is perfect for those who just want to press the &quot;Play&quot; button and immediately get ton of fun and activity.  Personally I really don't like spending time on room calibration. Luckily, in VRNOID you just hold the Thumbstick for a few seconds to adjust the height and direction. Additionally, you can play it while sitting or standing.</i>",
    "short_description": "VRNOID is the perfect mix of bricks breaker and Air Hockey in VR. Swing your striker to hit the ball. Destroy bricks and enemies, collect power-ups, and dodge bullets. Prepare yourself for challenging levels and bosses that are waiting for you in this retro arcade game.",
